{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":20017906,"chapterID":15000306,"chapterNumber":"III-6","sectionNumber":"36-231","title":"In districts with high, medium or low parking requirements","officialText":"","previewText":"C1-1 C1-2 C1-3 C2-1 C2-2 C2-3 C3 C4-1 C4-2 C4-3 C7 C8-1 C8-2\n\nIn the districts indicated, except for the uses listed in Section 36-233 (Exceptions to application of waiver provisions), and except as otherwise provided in Section 36-27 (Waiver for Certain Small Zoning Lots or Establishments), the parking requirements set forth in Sections 36-21 (General Provisions) or 36-22 (Special Provisions for a Single Zoning Lot ","blocks":[{"id":"zr-17906-block-001","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>C1-1 C1-2 C1-3 C2-1 C2-2 C2-3 C3 C4-1 C4-2 C4-3 C7 C8-1 C8-2</span></p>","plainText":"C1-1 C1-2 C1-3 C2-1 C2-2 C2-3 C3 C4-1 C4-2 C4-3 C7 C8-1 C8-2"},{"id":"zr-17906-block-002","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 0pt;\"><span>In the districts indicated, except for the <strong><em>uses</em></strong> listed in Section <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-6#36-233\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-6#36-233\"><span>36-233</span></a> (Exceptions to application of waiver provisions), and except as otherwise provided in Section <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-6#36-27\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-6#36-27\"><span>36-27</span></a> (Waiver for Certain Small Zoning Lots or Establishments), the parking requirements set forth in Sections <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-6#36-21\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-6#36-21\"><span>36-21</span></a> (General Provisions) or <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-6#36-22\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-6#36-22\"><span>36-22</span></a> (Special Provisions for a Single Zoning Lot With Uses Subject to Different Parking Requirements) shall not apply to <strong><em>commercial</em></strong> <strong><em>uses</em></strong> or to <strong><em>community facility</em></strong> <strong><em>uses</em></strong>, if the total number of <strong><em>accessory</em></strong> off-street parking spaces required for all such <strong><em>uses</em></strong> on the<strong><em> zoning lot</em></strong> is less than the number of spaces set forth in the following table:</span></p>","plainText":"In the districts indicated, except for the uses listed in Section 36-233 (Exceptions to application of waiver provisions), and except as otherwise provided in Section 36-27 (Waiver for Certain Small Zoning Lots or Establishments), the parking requirements set forth in Sections 36-21 (General Provisions) or 36-22 (Special Provisions for a Single Zoning Lot With Uses Subject to Different Parking Requirements) shall not apply to commercial uses or to community facility uses, if the total number of accessory off-street parking spaces required for all such uses on the zoning lot is less than the number of spaces set forth in the following table:"},{"id":"zr-17906-block-003","kind":"html","html":"<p><a id=\"t.994c959b5b7adfba48e68ae8c38fb481eca31364\"></a><a id=\"t.1\"></a></p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-17906-block-004","kind":"table","html":"<table style=\"margin-left:auto;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse;margin-right:auto\"><tbody><tr style=\"height:16.4pt\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-right-style:solid;border-bottom-color:<strong><em>000000;border-top-width:0pt;border-right-width:0pt;border-left-color:</em></strong>000000;vertical-align:top;border-right-color:<strong><em>000000;border-left-width:0pt;border-top-style:solid;border-left-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1pt;width